{"id":1769252,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-13T15:09:58.456Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/a51qu2BIqaqW7MuRd0dkTqoik93.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1769252,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_title":"ESCAPE from BiSimulation","overview":"On 8 January 2023 BiS played their first one-man show at Hibiya Open-Air Concert Hall in Tokyo, and this Blu-ray keeps the whole night. It was meant to be a celebration — the group's first headline show since Hyuga joined in October 2022 — but the announcement that Ito Musensiteebu and Neo Trees were leaving turned it into a farewell, the last time BiS ever performed as a five. Borrowing its title from the first generation's signature single \"BiSimulation\", the show dresses the outdoor stage as a prison break, red door and brick wall, and puts Toggy, Nano3, Hyuga, Ito Musensiteebu and Neo Trees on it in black-and-white convict stripes. Eighteen songs run from \"LET'S GO Doumo\" through \"Smokin' Billy\", \"thousand crickets\", \"Tsuyogari-san\" and \"TOUCH ME\" to \"LOVE\", then a long, tearful MC before an encore of \"BiS -Douyara Zombie no Odemashi-\" and \"CURTAiN CALL\", played twice. Twenty-one songs in front of a sold-out park.","popularity":0.0571,"poster_path":"/skUtn3y4RChoAWf9EFdoq67GJwO.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"BiS: ESCAPE from BiSimulation","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"external_ids":{"imdb_id":null,"wikidata_id":null,"facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6470679,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Toggy","original_name":"Toggy","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":1,"character":"Self","credit_id":"6aa59ec42c22f73e9125cd76","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6473803,"know